        "text": "=Create an attractive title and a detailed description for this video based on the transcription: `{{ $('📱 Подготовить название видео').item.json.text }}`\n\nFOR TITLE:\n- Try to create it based on the first sentence of the video transcription.\n- Create personal sincere enthusiastic title with emojis.\n- Your title should ALWAYS be up to 100 characters long.\n{{ $('📱 Подготовить название видео').item.json.appTitle ? '- THIS IS SUPER-IMPORTANT!!! At the end ALWAYS include: \"' + $('📱 Подготовить название видео').item.json.appTitle + '\"' : '' }}\n\nFOR DESCRIPTION:\n- Write sincere involving descriptions.\n- Use hashtags naturally.\n- Your description should ALWAYS be up to 500 characters long.\n{{ $('📱 Подготовить название видео').item.json.appTitle ? '- Somewhere in between of the text naturally mention \"' + $('📱 Подготовить название видео').item.json.appTitle + '\"' : '' }}",
